# Ollama: REAL_LLM_BASE_URL=http://localhost:11434/v1
# LM Studio: REAL_LLM_BASE_URL=http://localhost:1234/v1
# vLLM/llama.cpp server: use the server's /v1 base URL
# Set REAL_LLM_API_KEY to any non-empty value if your local server does not check keys.
